  "body": "I asked this in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/issues/21249 but maybe it's more a spec question than a test question.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/2f346208c2a115a601b580e7869fe112b97c4246/html/browsers/the-window-object/named-access-on-the-window-object/named-objects.html#L50-L58 asserts that frameset elements with a name attribute are not found by the window named getter, but https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-window-nameditem-filter still lists frameset elements. \r\n\r\nI think this might be due to a typo in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1869 since the PR comment indicates getting rid of framesets but in the actual commit framesets are still in the list.",
